{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our cats are now in the beautiful Rio de Janeiro! Let's search for them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A cozy and wholesome experience in the most recognizable city in Brazil!</strong> Start with a Beautiful monochromatic scenario, relax, and find all the cats to reveal the final colored art. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>More than 970 hidden objects to find!!!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play through different  levels in Rio de Janeiro!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Main Level:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find 200 cats in semi-random positions. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 12 Special cats that unlock Bonus Levels and give hints. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 20 city people to find and earn hints.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play also 7 Bonus levels with different sizes and numbers of kittens to find. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2780690?t=1748269103","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780690/968d6ef62e4f22a693368c9481698f1ecb328f15/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748269103","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780690/fb9f40cafd829a82af19eeb28c97dca4e9cccc3b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748269103","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2780690/fb9f40cafd829a82af19eeb28c97dca4e9cccc3b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748269103","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_p